rules.toml:9:10: channels[0].filter: "GFP" is not one of the filters ["DAPI", "DAPI"]
rules.toml:10:27: channels[0].illumination.source: there is no [peripherals.illumination]
rules.toml:10:48: channels[0].illumination.intensity: must be from 0 to 1, not 1.5
rules.toml:15:22: objectives[0].numerical_aperture: must be above 0 and at most 1.7, not 1.9
